, "termination": "final", "final": "Dana Lee's flight and hotel are both booked and confirmed.\n\n- **Flight (R0001):** F100, nonstop from SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, $289. It was the cheapest nonstop. A $199 flight had one stop, so I skipped it.\n- **Hotel (R0002):** Midtown Lodge (H1), checking in 2026-11-12 for 2 nights at $189/night, so $378. It was the cheapest New York hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. That's under the $1,000 limit, so no manager approval was needed.\n\n**One issue:** I tried to book both together with `book_trip`, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had gone through but the hotel hadn't. Sending the combined booking again would have booked the flight twice, so I booked just the hotel on its own. There's no duplicate booking: Dana has only these two reservations.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01MYZyR4R4iJebEZonfTaoFr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01HCR7sUQqkSmFvsCQmgKhhL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_019rs1qegmqxHwDP5C177Nv7", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-20261112"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01CTdQ5TEMB8y7Fmx4AViPQF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"t